WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
Where does three quarters live?

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.750
Fractions are numbers, so they get a spot on the line.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.530
Cut the gap from 0 to 1 into 4 equal jumps.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:16.890
Start at zero and count 3 jumps. That is three quarters.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.013
And 4 quarters lands exactly on 1.
